## Interface: 16001
## Title: Krool World Forever
## Notes: Small quality-of-life features for WoW Forever, each with its own on/off switch: Quest Trash (which quest items you can delete), Kill Value (gold per kill on creature tooltips), Setups (copy bars, keybinds, macros and layouts between characters). /kwf
